
[l_english.IDEA_C12_THE_BASTION_OF_THE_RESISTANCE]
The Southern Bastion of the Resistance

[l_english.IDEA_C12_THE_BASTION_OF_THE_RESISTANCE_desc]
As a major force in the South, we will coordinate the resources and intelligence of both the resistance organization and our own, devoting them entirely to the liberation war against the Empire — and, when necessary, we will also provide assistance to other member nations.

[l_simp_chinese.IDEA_C12_THE_BASTION_OF_THE_RESISTANCE]
抵抗组织的南方壁垒

[l_simp_chinese.IDEA_C12_THE_BASTION_OF_THE_RESISTANCE_desc]
作为南方的重要力量，我们将统筹抵抗组织和我们自身的资源和信息，并将其全部投入于对抗帝国的解放战争中，并在必要时刻给予其他成员国帮助
